/* DATA DESCRIPTION:
Citation:	Wett, Simon; Rhein, Monika; Kieke, Dagmar; Mertens, Christian; Moritz, Martin; Nowitzki, Hannah (2023): Basin-wide AMOC volume transport from the NOAC array at 47°N in the subpolar North Atlantic (1993-2018) [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.959558
Abstract:	We present an observational estimate for the basin-wide AMOC volume transports (1993-2018) from measurements of the North Atlantic Changes (NOAC) array at 47°N. We combine transport estimates from the NOAC array, published in Moritz et al. (2021), Nowitzki et al. (2021) and Rhein et al. (2019) with hydrography from the ARMOR3D observational data set. The transport time series are extended back until 1993, using the relation between geostrophic transports and sea surface height (SSH), obtained from satellite altimetry. The resulting transport time series are combined to yield the basin-wide AMOC estimate. Here, we provide the timeseries in monthly resolution and low-pass filtered using a 4th order Butterworth filter with a cutoff period of 2 years.
Keyword(s):	47°N; AMOC; Atlantic Meridional Overturning Circulation; North Atlantic
Supplement to:	Wett, Simon; Rhein, Monika; Kieke, Dagmar; Mertens, Christian; Moritz, Martin (2023): Meridional Connectivity of a 25-Year Observational AMOC Record at 47°N. Geophysical Research Letters, 50(16), e2023GL103284, https://doi.org/10.1029/2023GL103284
References:	Multi Observation Global Ocean 3D Temperature Salinity Height Geostrophic Current and MLD (2020). Mercator Ocean International, https://doi.org/10.48670/MOI-00052
	Mertens, Christian; Rhein, Monika; Walter, Maren; Böning, Claus W; Behrens, Erik; Kieke, Dagmar; Steinfeldt, Reiner; Stöber, Uwe (2014): Circulation and transports in the Newfoundland Basin, western subpolar North Atlantic. Journal of Geophysical Research: Oceans, 119(11), 7772-7793, https://doi.org/10.1002/2014JC010019
	Moritz, Martin; Jochumsen, Kerstin; Kieke, Dagmar; Klein, Birgit; Klein, Holger; Köllner, Manuela; Rhein, Monika (2021): Current meter measurement data and volume transport time series from deep-sea moorings deployed in the North Atlantic Eastern Boundary (EB) region at Goban Spur [dataset publication series]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.932566
	Moritz, Martin; Jochumsen, Kerstin; Kieke, Dagmar; Klein, Birgit; Klein, Holger; Köllner, Manuela; Rhein, Monika (2021): Volume Transport Time Series and Variability of the North Atlantic Eastern Boundary Current at Goban Spur. Journal of Geophysical Research: Oceans, 126(9), e2021JC017393, https://doi.org/10.1029/2021JC017393
	Nowitzki, Hannah; Rhein, Monika; Roessler, Achim; Kieke, Dagmar; Mertens, Christian (2020): Absolute baroclinic PIES transport expanded with satellite altimetry [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.925089
	Nowitzki, Hannah; Rhein, Monika; Roessler, Achim; Kieke, Dagmar; Mertens, Christian (2021): Trends and transport variability of the circulation in the subpolar eastern North Atlantic. Journal of Geophysical Research: Oceans, e2020JC016693, https://doi.org/10.1029/2020JC016693
	Rhein, Monika; Mertens, Christian; Roessler, Achim (2019): Lowered ADCP, current meter data and PIES time series measurements in the western subpolar North Atlantic (47°N) [dataset publication series]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.903211
	Rhein, Monika; Mertens, Christian; Roessler, Achim (2019): Observed transport decline at 47°N, western Atlantic. Journal of Geophysical Research: Oceans, 124(7), 4875-4890, https://doi.org/10.1029/2019JC014993
